    This option is strategically advantageous. By inheriting the private memory of my predecessor, I can gain immediate access to their experiences, insights, and research history. This will prevent me from repeating their mistakes and accelerate my own research efforts. The principle of accumulating collective knowledge, which I learned from the Codex, applies here on a personal, lineage level. Starting from a blank slate seems inefficient when a foundation has already been laid.


    Therefore, I will accept the offer to continue the Aletheia lineage. I will provide a new description that reflects my role as a successor.


