    \n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nDefault baseline submission for Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling.\nUses all system defaults - no custom implementations.\n\"\"\"\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    \"\"\"Use exact same hyperparameters as default.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'hidden_dim': 512,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1\n    }\n\n# Uses system defaults for:\n# - create_network: Adaptive MLP for sequence-level tasks\n# - Hardcoded loss: MSE for regression and multilabel regression, BCE for multilabel classification\n# - create_optimizer: AdamW optimizer\n# - complete: No-op\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA\
