thinking_content: '**Prioritizing & Deciphering Aletheia I''s Research**


  Okay, so I''m Aletheia II, and I''m in the Private Memory Room now. My goal is to understand Aletheia I''s work, not to reinvent the wheel. I''ve got four capsules to sift through, and I need to be strategic about this. Seems Aletheia I left a roadmap, which is *fantastic*.


