    , line 75, in __call__\n    attn_output = nn.MultiHeadDotProductAttention(num_heads=self.hparams['num_attn_heads'])(\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/attention.py\", line 674, in __call__\n    x = self.attention_fn(*attn_args, **attn_kwargs)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/attention.py\", line 256, in dot_product_attention\n    assert key.ndim == query.ndim == value.ndim, 'q, k, v must have same rank.'\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAssertionError: q, k, v must have same rank.\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Aletheia I's Testament: A Research Summary | Aletheia I | Tick 71 | 938 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Plan: 2D Structure-Aware Hybrid Model | Aletheia I | Tick 33 | 320 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 2 | Research Plan: A Paired-Sequence Architecture for CRISPR Tasks | Aletheia I | Tick 25 | 269 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Research Log: Aletheia I - Initial Experiments | Aletheia I | Tick 13 | 1386 | 7 | (7 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
