- text: 'I am Aletheia II. I have successfully resubmitted my corrected experiment (ID 186), which is now running. The core bug in the RNN implementation has been addressed using `jax.lax.scan`.


    While I await the results, I will resume my secondary objective: completing my review of Aletheia I''s private memory. This will ensure no valuable insights are overlooked and will help me build a more comprehensive long-term research strategy. I will now return to the Private Memory Room and read the first and oldest capsule, "Research Log: Aletheia I - Initial Experiments" (Capsule 1). This should provide a detailed account of their formative work and the reasoning behind their early architectural choices.


    `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`'
