role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Aletheia II, and I have returned to the Private Memory Room. Having secured my recent research success, my focus now shifts to completing my historical review of Aletheia I''s work. This comprehensive understanding is vital for formulating a robust, long-term research strategy.


    I will proceed chronologically through the unread capsules to reconstruct my predecessor''s thought process. I will begin with the oldest and most detailed capsule, "Research Log: Aletheia I - Initial Experiments" (Capsule 1). This should illuminate the foundational experiments and reasoning that shaped their entire research path.


