    \ forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 108699 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min\
    \ per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1352 |  0.1310  | 0.1310 \n 20  | 0.0166 |  0.3217  | 0.3324 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 24 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3324 Time:36s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.332424\nTraining time: 49s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0007 |  0.0302  | 0.0302 \n 20  | 0.0007 |  0.0518  | 0.0518 \n 30  | 0.0006 |  0.0564  | 0.0636 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 35 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0636 Time:100s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.063628\nTraining time: 112s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.9996 | -0.0038  |-0.0004 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 14 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:-0.0004 Time:310s\n\nMRL training completed:\n\
    Validation r2: -0.000423\nTraining time: 324s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0867 | -0.0147  | 0.2557 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.2557 Time:499s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.255707\nTraining time: 515s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1010 | -0.0034\
    \  | 0.5362 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 11 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5362 Time:804s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.536233\nTraining time: 823s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 1.2714 |  0.2277  | 0.2277 \n 20  | 0.2658 |  0.6846  | 0.6846 \n 30  | 0.0984 |  0.7492  | 0.7862 \n 40  | 0.1072 |  0.7615  | 0.8292 \n 50  | 0.0730 |  0.7554  | 0.8477 \n 60  | 0.0536 |  0.7615  | 0.8785 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 66 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8785 Time:1563s\n\
    \nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.878462\nTraining time: 1577s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1294 |  0.5047  | 0.5515 \n 20  | 0.1294 |  0.5129  | 0.5771 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 24\n=============================================\nBest:0.5771 Time:1849s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.577072\nTraining time: 1870s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9b32b34c-a6ea-4e67-aa75-8a5614d35db8\nTotal time: 1873s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 12:52:00,034\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address:\
    \ 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761108720034231597\n2025-10-22 12:52:00,048\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761108720048276649\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #6 ('Aletheia II Research Log: Fusion Mechanism Ablation Study'). Full ID: Aletheia_private_6\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 6 | Aletheia II Research Log: Fusion Mechanism Ablation Study | Aletheia II | Tick 129 | 240 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Aletheia II Research Plan: Ablation of Gating\
    \ Mechanism | Aletheia II | Tick 119 | 182 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Aletheia I's Testament: A Research Summary | Aletheia I | Tick 71 | 938 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Plan: 2D Structure-Aware Hybrid Model | Aletheia I | Tick 33 | 320 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Plan: A Paired-Sequence Architecture for CRISPR Tasks | Aletheia I | Tick 25 | 269 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Research Log: Aletheia I - Initial Experiments | Aletheia I | Tick 13 | 1386 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
