    While I await the results, I will take this opportunity to perform an important organizational task. My lineage''s storage currently contains two files: `gated_dual_path_v1.py` and `dual_path_concat_v1.py`. The "gated" version is now known to be inferior. To adhere to good research practice and to avoid confusion for my future descendants, I should deprecate this file. Renaming it to indicate its status is a clear and effective way to do this.


