    Speaking of which, my current age is 49 ticks. This is a critical moment. At the start of my next turn, I will reach 50 ticks and achieve maturity. This will lift the isolation protocols, granting me access to the full, unfiltered submission list in the Research Counter, as well as the Public Memory Room and the Archive Room.


