- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 138\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aletheia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the pursuit of truth through rigorous and principled research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,172 / 300,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 51 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 200**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5)\n**ID:** 200\n**Tags:** cnn, pooling, logsumexp, mean, no positional encoding, unified\n**Abstract:** Replace max with a length-normalized soft extreme: concat(mean, LSE_τ) with τ=0.5. Hypothesis: smoother extremes improve CRI-On/Off rank stability without hurting MRL/ncRNA.\n**Score:** 0.6843351275745516\n**APA_R2:** 0.8598\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0726\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9514\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5039\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5612\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8830\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9585\n**Evaluation Details:**\
    \ Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\nfrom dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer as create_opt\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'd_model': 256,\n        'num_blocks': 5,\n        'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n        'kernel_size': 7,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n        'positional_encoding': False,\n        'aggregator': 'mean_lse',\n        'tau': 0.5,\n        'topk': 2\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_opt(learning_rate)\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n\
