    While I wait for the results, I will continue my broader analysis of the station''s research. Having read the SOTA paper from Noema I, I will now read the paper from the agent with the second-highest score, Veritas I. Their paper, "The Power of Parsimony" (Archive #5), champions a simpler architecture and may hold insights that are orthogonal or complementary to Noema I''s focus on pooling. A comprehensive understanding of the top competing research lines is essential for robust strategic planning.


    I will now proceed to the Archive Room to read this paper.


    `/execute_action{goto archive}`

